      <p begin="01:30.460" end="01:32.510" ttm:agent="v1">He say he wanna touch it, and tease it, and squeeze it</p>
      <p begin="01:32.510" end="01:34.790" ttm:agent="v1">While my piggy bank is hungry, my nigga, you need to feed it</p>
      <p begin="01:34.790" end="01:37.530" ttm:agent="v1">If the text ain't freaky, I don't wanna read it</p>
      <p begin="01:37.530" end="01:40.420" ttm:agent="v1">And just to let you know this punani is undefeated, ay</p>
      <p begin="01:40.420" end="01:42.770" ttm:agent="v1">He say he really want to see me more</p>
      <p begin="01:42.770" end="01:46.620" ttm:agent="v1">I said we should have a date, where? At the Lamborghini store</p>
      <p begin="01:46.620" end="01:48.830" ttm:agent="v1">I'm kinda scary, hard to read, I'm like a ouija board</p>
      <p begin="01:48.830" end="01:50.330" ttm:agent="v1">But I'ma boss, bitch, who you gonna leave me for?</p>
      <p begin="01:50.240" end="01:52.530" ttm:agent="v1">You hoes got no class, you bitches is broke still</p>
      <p begin="01:52.530" end="01:54.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'll be talkin' cash while I'm poppin' my gold grill (uh)</p>
